  "solution": {
    "text": "This method is known as Clark's process. In this method temporary hardness is removed byadding lime water or milk of lime.\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\mathrm{Ca}(\\mathrm{OH})_{2}+\\mathrm{Ca}\\left(\\mathrm{HCO}_{3}\\right)_{2} \\longrightarrow \\underset{\\mathrm{ppt} .}{2 \\mathrm{CaCO}_{3}} \\downarrow+2 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}\r\n\r\n$$",
